# Field help (? icon)

Do **not** put how-to or explanatory copy under labels, in muted `<small>` / `<p>` blocks, or in form intros.

Use **`app-help-text`** next to the **label or section title** and register the copy in **`admin/src/app/core/help-text.registry.ts`**.

```html
<label for="code">Invoice code <app-help-text key="organization.invoiceCode" /></label>
```

## Do not

- `<small class="text-color-secondary">…</small>` (or `text-muted`) under a field to explain it
- Section `<p class="text-color-secondary">…</p>` that teaches how a feature works
- Duplicate the same copy in the help drawer and under the field — pick the ? registry for field/section tooltips; page-level narrative stays in `ui/help-drawer/help-content.ts`

## OK to keep visible

- Empty states (`No expenses yet`), loading text, validation errors, live computed values (e.g. mileage × rate = total)
- User-authored content (form intro text, task-form question help from the builder)
- Short placeholders in inputs when they are examples, not instructions

## Dollar amount fields

Use **`app-money-input`** (`admin/src/app/ui/money-input/`) for USD amounts. Do not use `p-inputNumber` with `mode="currency"` or `prefix="$"` — PrimeNG rewrites keystrokes and breaks sub-$1 values.

## New or changed fields

Add or update a registry key in the same change. Key format: `area.field` (e.g. `settings.business.mileageRate`).
